      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crossville%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "On February 28 2017, an EF3 wedge tornado touched down in Crossville, damaging the village and claiming one life.",
